OTOGAKURE — CLASSIFIED EXPERIMENT LOG
CLEARANCE: MEDIC CADRE / LORD OROCHIMARU
Ref: CX-CM-LOG

Program: Cursed Seal Application Trials

Purpose
Track application outcomes for the Heaven and Earth cursed seals across candidate pools.
This is an administrative log; procedure detail resides in Research & Experiments.

Cohort Summary
- Cohort A (10 subjects): survival 1. Surviving subject stabilized to Level 1 within
  three weeks. Retained for guard duty.
- Cohort B (10 subjects): survival 1. Subject shows aptitude for Level 2; assigned to
  advanced training under supervision.
- Cohort C (10 subjects): survival 0. Seal rejection in all cases. Cohort closed.
- Cohort D (in progress): 4 of 10 stable at time of writing.

Observations
Baseline survival holds near one in ten. Chakra reserve at intake correlates with
survival more strongly than age. Recommend raising the reserve threshold at selection to
conserve subject stock.

Disposition
Non-survivors and rejects logged to the subject roster and disposed per compound
protocol. Survivors advance to the seal-bearer registry and health-monitoring schedule.

Filed by Head Medic on behalf of Lord Orochimaru.
